                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Prof Hustad is incredible engaged with her students during all parts of the lecture. She makes CSD110 exciting and fun to be in and is very clear what information needs to be learned. Would recommend class to any student-even if the course is for a prereq.",
